{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-11-17 10:00:00', 'title': 'HII NAMES MISSION TRAINING EXPERT TO EXPAND TRAINING SOLUTIONS TO U.S. AIR FORCE', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., NOV. 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MIKE ALDINGER HAS JOINED ITS TECHNICAL SOLUTIONS DIVISION AS VICE PRESIDENT OF HII'S LIVE, VIRTUAL, CONSTRUCTIVE (LVC) TRAINING SOLUTIONS WITH A FOCUS ON GROWTH AND ENGAGEMENTS WITH THE U.S. AIR FORCE. HII'S LVC TRAINING SOLUTIONS TEAM OFFERS ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE-DRIVEN ADVANCED SIMULATION CAPABILITIES, INCLUDING VIRTUAL AND AUGMENTED REALITY AND LARGE, INTEGRATED EXERCISES AROUND THE GLOBE, TO ENABLE THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE TO MEET CRITICAL READINESS REQUIREMENTS."}